<title>USA: Berry Pete chairman retires, Hoffman tapped.</title>
<headline>Berry Pete chairman retires, Hoffman tapped.</headline>
<dateline>TAFT, Calif. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berry Petroleum Co said Tuesday that Harvey Bryant will retire as chairman of the board and as a director, effective March 21, 1997.</p>
<p>Jerry Hoffman, president and chief executive officer, will replace Bryant as chairman of the board, and retain his other posts, the company said.</p>
<p>Hoffman has been president and chief executive officer since May 1994, when Bryant retired from these positions.</p>
